          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagatsindishiriza abakiranirwa ku bw'impongano, ariko umukiranutsi bakamwima ibyo atsindiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero nk'uko ibirimi by'umuriro bikongora ibitsinsi, kandi nk'uko ubwatsi bwumye buhwama mu muriro, ni ko igishyitsi cyabo kizaba ikibore, n'uburabyo buzuma butumuke nk'umukungugu, kuko banze amategeko y'Uwiteka Nyiringabo, bagahinyura ijambo ry'Uwera wa Isirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo gitumye Uwiteka arakarira ubwoko bwe uburakari bukongora nk'umuriro, akabangurira ukuboko kwe kubica, imisozi igahinda umushyitsi, maze intumbi zabo zikamera nk'ibishingwe binyanyagiye mu mayira. Nyamara uburakari bwe ntiburashira, ahubwo ukuboko kwe kuracyabanguye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Imana ihagurukiriza amahanga ubwoko bwayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azamanikira amahanga ya kure ibendera, azabahamagaza ikivugirizo ngo bave ku mpera y'isi, na bo bazaza n'ingoga bihuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri bo nta wuzananirwa ngo asitare, nta wuzahunikira ngo asinzire, nta wuzakenyuruka kandi n'udushumi tw'inkweto zabo ntituzacika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imyambi yabo iratyaye n'imiheto yabo yose irabanze, inzara z'amafarashi yabo zizamera nk'amasarabwayi, n'inziga z'amagare yabo zizagenda nka serwakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwivuga kwabo kuzaba nk'ukw'intare, bazīvuga nk'imigunzu y'intare. Ni koko bazīvuga bafate umuhigo wabo bawujyane amahoro, kandi nta murengezi uzaba ahari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
